                                "sense_id": "9fea8512-57c0-3fba-b948-82b508a857d2",
                                "text": "I've been steaming a lot a veggies and I can get that down without any problem. It's a very good thing I am on Aciphex now as I think my stomach would have imploded by now. With me, I -HAVE- to get back in shape. It's mando becuase^([sic]) the Navy says so. Chuckle."
                            },
